      "risk_review": {
        "status": "complete",
        "reviewer": "alpha-batch-46",
        "notes": "Checked rank-one supplier denominator and 1/eta trace bound and current AC McDiarmid interface: resolvent components are bounded continuous functions of finite vectors. Replacement oscillation 2/(d eta), real/imaginary union at t/sqrt(2), and exponent -t^2 d^2 eta^2/(4n) are correct. Common probability space repairs Borel-Cantelli across n; no cross-n independence is assumed."
