        "notes": "Checked all seven steps: leave-one-row cone keeps denominators >=eta/|z|; quadratic variance estimate and trace replacement yield expectation residual O(p^-1/2). AC McDiarmid concentration transfers residual to deterministic expectations. Quadratic roots have D-values summing to imaginary part -eta, so at most one meets Im D<=-eta. Common law fixes uniform fourth moment; variance of trace energy is (mu4-1)/(np), summable. Dense transforms, tightness, AC subsequence extraction and countable-choice inversion close weak convergence. Common-space/common-law and AC-to-countable-choice reader repairs are necessary and sufficient."
