        "reviewer": "alpha-batch-46",
        "notes": "Checked both verification steps: gamma=1/4 gives endpoints 1/4,9/4, density coefficient 2/pi, zero atom zero and eventual full column rank. Nested iid real array and explicit AC satisfy weak-law and independent edge suppliers, with countable choice derived from AC. Reader bridge adds explicit audit evidence without changing the Example. All probability-one conclusions intersect; edges are not inferred from weak ESD convergence."
