        "notes": "Checked all 41 steps: tree contour bijection and residue coefficient count, fourth centered moment cluster bound O(n^-2), nonnegative rectangular strong law, dilation singular-value comparison, fixed-K truncation followed by K to infinity using the assumed coarse norm, and explicit polynomial witnesses at both edges. At gamma=1 the x factor removes exact zeros and the positive interval may lie arbitrarily near zero; no weak ESD supplier is used. Variance zero is admitted in the auxiliary bounded-entry calculation."
